aozora2html — CC0 1.0 Universal
https://github.com/aozorahack/aozora2html
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Aozora Bunko gaiji and accent tables, Resources/Assets/aozora-jis2ucs.json
and Resources/Assets/aozora-accent.json, are generated by
scripts/aozora_tables.py from aozora2html's yml/jis2ucs.yml and
yml/accent_table.yml at commit 9ca5395; aozora-tables.manifest.json records the
checksums. The Aozora Bunko parser in Modules/Core/Aozora/ ports aozora2html's
rules (header.rb, ruby_buffer.rb, style_stack.rb, yml/command_table.yml).
aozora2html is dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0; no attribution is
required, and it is given here as a courtesy.

